OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Ffor much of the day, although some
OL,7,Fbrighter spells are possible during
OL,8,Fthe morning. Rain turning heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes during the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Fstarting generally light, but becoming
OL,11,Fbreezy later in the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain to start the evening
OL,14,Fwill clear towards midnight, to leave
OL,15,Flargely dry conditions with clear
OL,16,Fspells. Becoming chilly with a frost
OL,17,Fdeveloping in places. Winds easing
OL,18,Fthrough the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
