OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly start, but
OL,6,Fgenerally a bright day with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a few isolated showers,
OL,8,Fmainly in the west. Winds mostly light
OL,9,Fthroughout. Rain arriving overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,12,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,14,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,15,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,16,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
